rred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-10T18:05:42Z","updated_at":"2025-01-10T18:05:42Z","body":"> You need to generate the documentation from the actual code, see [updating the class reference](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/documentation/updating_the_class_reference.html#updating-class-reference-when-working-on-the-engine), you've bound it with `for_resource` so it should be that\r\n> \r\n> ```c++\r\n> ClassDB::bind_method(D_METHOD(\"find_resource_conversion_plugin_for_resource\", \"for_resource\"), &EditorInterface::find_resource_conversion_plugin_for_resource);\r\n> ```\r\n\r\nAh I see.  I'll go fix that.  Thank you! :)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2583422366/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2583570080","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101399#issuecomment-2583570080","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101399","id":2583570080,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Z_iag","user":{"login":"TCROC","id":24307049,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzA3MDQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24307049?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC","html_url":"https://github.com/TCROC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-10T18:47:32Z","updated_at":"2025-01-10T18:47:32Z","body":"@Calinou can't believe I forgot to shoutout u in the pr.  Edited u in 😎","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2583570080/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2589503702","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101399#issuecomment-2589503702","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101399","id":2589503702,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aWLDW","user":{"login":"QbieShay","id":7917475,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTc0NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7917475?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay","html_url":"https://github.com/QbieShay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-14T10:07:47Z","updated_at":"2025-01-14T10:07:47Z","body":"Hello @TCROC and thank you for this contribution!\r\n\r\nUsually before opening PR we ask contributors to [create a proposal](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues) first so that we can discuss the design of the new features, and more importantly, discuss first the problem and see which solution is best, so that we try and reduce the chance that an open PR gets rejected.\r\n\r\nRight now we're too close to beta to implement new features (especially undiscussed ones), so it will take time to get back to this. \r\n\r\nIn the meantime i suggest you open a proposal so that other users sharing similar problems may chime in.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2589503702/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2590848979","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101399#issuecomment-2590848979","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101399","id":2590848979,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6abTfT","user":{"login":"TCROC","id":24307049,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzA3MDQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24307049?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC","html_url":"https://github.com/TCROC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-14T18:44:27Z","updated_at":"2025-01-14T18:44:27Z","body":"Hey @QbieShay !  Thanks for the heads up!  I opened a feature proposal here: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11561.\r\n\r\nI'm not too concerned if this PR doesn't get merged in.  Its a change / feature that I found useful and added in our fork.  I wanted to make sure to give back to the engine and community that has given so much to us! :)  I figured others may find this feature useful.  If it doesn't get merged in, it doesn't bother me any.  Unless it becomes too difficult to maintain in parallel regarding conflicts and such.  Then I may try to bring more attention to it.  But this change was simple enough that I doubt it will pose any trouble for us.\r\n\r\nThanks again! :)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2590848979/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":3,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2652647682","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101399#issuecomment-2652647682","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101399","id":2652647682,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eHDEC","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-12T04:38:41Z","updated_at":"2025-02-12T04:38:41Z","body":"Notably, you can already convert a VisualShader to a Shader in GDScript by reading the `VisualShader.code` property without this PR, which can achieve the same result as what `VisualShaderConversionPlugin::convert` does.\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ad9abe841d9bb47a397c5e1a314ced1c5abc1ccd/editor/plugins/visual_shader_editor_plugin.cpp#L8268-L8279","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2652647682/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2653613650","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101399#issuecomment-2653613650","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101399","id":2653613650,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eKu5S","user":{"login":"TCROC","id":24307049,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzA3MDQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24307049?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC","html_url":"https://github.com/TCROC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-12T12:46:09Z","updated_at":"2025-02-12T12:46:09Z","body":"> Notably, you can already convert a VisualShader to a Shader in GDScript by reading the `VisualShader.code` property without this PR, which can achieve the same result as what `VisualShaderConversionPlugin::convert` does.\n> \n> https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ad9abe841d9bb47a397c5e1a314ced1c5abc1ccd/editor/plugins/visual_shader_editor_plugin.cpp#L8268-L8279\n\nThis is actually the initial approach that I took believe it or not! :) But I ran into an issue where the conversion wasn't 1 to 1. I thought maybe there was extra logic in the conversion method that the code property missed. At the moment that isn't the case. I opened an issue here:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101375\n\nIt will depend on the solution to that issue if this PR is still necessary.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2653613650/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2653654166","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101399#issueco